      "arabic": "١١٤٩١- علية:\nبالتصغير، بنت شريح الحضرميّ «٤» . أخت السائب بن يزيد لأمه، وهي أخت\nمخرمة بن شريح الّذي ذكر عند النبي ﵌، فقال: «ذلك رجل لا يتوسّد القرآن» «٥» .",
      "english": "11491—Ulayya:\n\nIn the diminutive form; bint Shurayh al-Hadrami.[4] She was the maternal sister of al-Sa'ib ibn Yazid, and the sister of Makhrama ibn Shurayh, who was mentioned in the presence of the Prophet (may Allah bless him and grant him peace), whereupon he said: “That is a man who does not take the Qur'an as a pillow.”[5]",
